1 shopping festival, several Chinese brands claimed first place in different categories. Thunderbird Innovation s", "preview_zh": "今年双11，多个中国品牌在不同榜单上宣称第一。雷鸟创新称登顶京东智能眼镜与XR设备榜，阿里夸克称S1型号领跑XR热卖榜。但中国整体市场没有一家公司占据明显优势。Omdia数据显示，2026年上半年，阿里、影目和小米的市场份额分别为17.4%、14.6%和14.0%。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 1027, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/105/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 116.75, "size_bytes": 701424, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 309, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/105/en_b2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 118.825, "size_bytes": 713952, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 309, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/105/en_b2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/105/en_b2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 126.525, "size_bytes": 760176, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 309, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/105/en_b2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/105/en_b2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 110.975, "size_bytes": 666864, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 309, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/105/en_b2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/105/en_b2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 119.9, "size_bytes": 720288, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 309, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/105/en_b2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@9aa203d0/content/data/versions/1044.json"}], "en_c1": [{"content_hash": "8bcda75f0b3924a7", "version_id": 1045